WEBVTT

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:06.960
That almost hit us.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:07.940
Get us moving.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.370
They'll shoot us down.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.800
Can you call the wind?

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.400
You should be able to blow away that smoke.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.160
I have been trying.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:19.650
But...

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.710
Just the fact that you tried is a step forward.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.350
Message from the student plane!

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:28.150
"We've broken through the smoke.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.920
Will observe enemy fleet!"

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.530
We can't trust a student's observations!

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.260
New message!

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:37.510
"This is Noriaki Kashiwabara and Benjamin Sharif."

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.960
<b>Episode 11: 
Love Song</b>

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.220
That's it!

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.950
That's probably their flagship!

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:22.120
Its armor and cannons are a 
match for the <i>Luna Barco</i>'s.

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.070
This is bad...

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:26.260
Then we're strategically even?

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:29.330
The <i>Luna Barco</i> is worse off 
because it can't see them.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.740
And their shots have nearly hit us.

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:33.590
It may just wipe us out!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:39.150
Then, we need to do our best here 
to tell the <i>Barco</i> their location!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:42.390
Enemy above us, to the right!

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.100
Hang on, Benji!

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:49.780
Give me a break!

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.180
"Altitude 2,700...

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:55.000
Speed 27 knots.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.660
Horizontal distance 9,000.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.400
Course 2-7-3.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.570
<i>Luna Barco</i>, just fire at them!

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.570
Wind speed 10 knots."

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.420
Rounds incoming... Now!

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.720
"N! N! N!

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:07.490
All N's!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.750
Horizontal distance to enemy battleship 1,300!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:11.840
Altitude disparity 700.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:13.000
We missed all of them!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.920
Enemy is proceeding toward you, 
through the smokescreen!"

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.350
"Close...

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:33.230
Third round was within 800 meters.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.570
You need to get a better bead on them."

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.130
Message from the students...

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:38.780
We almost had them!

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.030
Ready another volley!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.280
Noripii... Benji!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.440
Can we really trust information from students?

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.320
Benjamin Sharif had top marks on his tests.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.830
And I will guarantee his strong 
sense of responsibility.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:02.030
They're risking their lives and 
honor to send you this data.

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:03.800
Please accept it.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.690
I'll accept the two students as temporary observers.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.190
Incoming fire!

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:22.900
What?

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:27.920
Direct hit!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.920
Starboard AA gun disabled. 
All gunners there are dead.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:33.720
Sectors 24 to 31 damaged! 
Fires have broken out!

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:35.700
Get firefighting teams out there at once!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.960
It'll take more than that to sink this ship!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.650
Adjust our targeting coordinates!

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.170
Reduce our area of effect!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.920
The enemy ship was almost hit there.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.560
Someone's spotting.

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:01.010
It's Noriaki and Benji...

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:01.730
Let's go!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.530
Message from the <i>Luna Barco</i>...

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.040
They've designated us as observers!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.820
Took them long enough!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.420
Two enemies overhead.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.630
Dodge, Noriaki!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.130
Kal!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.730
They'll handle the enemies!

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:48.080
We'll move in closer, and focus on spotting.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.540
We must be as accurate as possible.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.540
Hurry...

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:52.410
We'll get the information they need!

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:54.790
Yeah!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.930
Got it... This is an important job!

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.940
Closer... Can you get us closer?

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:12.090
I'm surprised you're this fired-up, Benji...

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.470
Yes, so am I.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:17.890
Let's go!

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:21.110
We'll sink this battleship here!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.430
We won't let them touch Isla!

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:31.770
We'll send the <i>Luna Barco</i> 
the detailed information...

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.080
required to sink it!

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:37.330
Okay!

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.130
Do it!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.020
"Altitude 2,230...

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.260
Speed 21 knots.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.890
Course north-west-west.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.240
Wind heading east-southeast."

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.140
That does it!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.650
Okay, we're out of here!

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:14.160
Secondary observer has gotten 
close to the enemy battleship!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.030
We have detailed coordinates!

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:21.030
We've lost contact with secondary observer!

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.080
What?

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.400
Was there any more information from it?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:24.130
No!

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:29.760
Send the data to the gunners.

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.300
If we don't sink them, we'll fail 
in our duty as knights.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.450
Hit them, no matter what.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.300
Yes, sir!

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:45.310
Benji! Hey!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.140
Wake up, Benji!

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:48.920
Benji!

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:51.110
Wake up! Benji!

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.380
<i>My right hand...</i>

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:09.880
<i>I see...</i>

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.590
<i>I smell flowers?</i>

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:19.600
Promise me that you'll return.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:22.090
<i>I promised...</i>

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.110
<i>That's right...</i>

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.510
<i>She gave me a good luck charm.</i>

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:31.200
<i>But what was it?</i>

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:41.120
I swear that I'll come back to you!

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.750
<i>Thank you, Sharon.</i>

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.710
<i>I'll return, no matter what!</i>

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.820
Incoming fire!

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:55.380
There it is!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.790
Noriaki, get us out of here!

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:04.610
Oh, crap...

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.230
Direct hit.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.020
All rounds...

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.140
have hit!

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.070
We did it!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:19.410
Noripii!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:20.490
Benji!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.420
Noriaki...

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.870
Noriaki!

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:30.880
Noriaki!

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:42.290
Forgive me, Sharon...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:46.370
Benji!

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.480
Noripii!

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.230
Benji...

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.520
Your hand!

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:01.240
He's saying, "Don't worry about me."

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.260
Noripii!

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:05.800
Benji!

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.660
Noripii!

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:10.390
Benji!

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:18.970
Here they come!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.100
You'll pay for that...

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.140
What is your problem?

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:33.820
You're bugging the hell out of me!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:37.440
You made Ari cry.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.570
You made Chiharu cry.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:46.040
And now you want to make 
Nanako and Sharon cry, too?!

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:47.790
You...

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.170
I'll make you pay...

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:02.050
I won't let anyone else die!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.210
I won't let it end here!

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:07.450
I'll protect everyone... And Isla!

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:12.150
Enemy dreadnought sunk!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.690
What about the students?

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:15.020
No response!

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:20.170
So we've sacrificed more brave students?

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:25.330
Does that mean those two have died?

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:28.940
Ma'am, this is a battlefield.

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:32.290
Soldiers die here all the time.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.360
But...

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.800
But we could at least look for them!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.630
We can keep fighting, right?

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:41.340
At this distance, we can target them directly!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.630
Excellent...

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:45.790
Show them what our gunners can do.

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:52.140
Once again, I can do nothing?

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.400
Enemy above!

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.000
Evasive maneuvers!

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.600
Prepare to counterattack!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.480
Light fuses on the delayed-fire rounds!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.860
They won't let us go?

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.830
Down, to our right.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:14.670
Three hundred meters.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.390
<i>You...</i>

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:27.280
<i>He was born the crown prince of the empire,</i>

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.270
<i>but he also has what it 
takes to be an ace pilot?</i>

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.710
<i>That isn't fair.</i>

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.640
<i>How can he be so lucky?!</i>

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.260
Hey, where are you going?

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:42.240
Below us!

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:00.290
Report.

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:01.600
Main engines are off line.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:02.760
We can't maintain our altitude!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.470
We're taking more damage.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.010
We can't fire our main gun!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:06.970
Damn it.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.050
Backup engines are off line.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.720
We cannot continue to fight!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.270
Head into the wind, and raise our speed.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.560
Keep fighting to the last.

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:19.310
Am I going to die here?

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:22.760
I am, aren't I?

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:25.090
You're very calm.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:31.660
Yes, I'm sure it's better that I die here.

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:34.660
It's an El Halcon.

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.750
Someone's still survived?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.840
The El Halcon is approaching at high speed.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.210
It's passing to starboard!

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:49.040
Kal-el!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:50.350
Why?

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.760
Is that your friend?

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.600
He's quite talented...

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.380
That was a signal round.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.310
We will escort you.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:07.910
As Claire Cruz, isn't there something 
you want to tell him?

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.960
One last bullet.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.940
<i>Is this how it ends?</i>

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:45.170
<i>What did I learn from Michael?</i>

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.980
<i>Mitsuo, Wolfgang, Fausto...</i>

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.860
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:54.280
Hey!

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:56.830
That's...

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:02.440
Nina Viento...

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:11.340
I'm sorry, Kal-el!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.520
You don't have to forgive me.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:18.600
Because of my power, you suffered so much.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.000
I'm sorry about what happened to your mother!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.880
I'm a terrible person...

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.460
After all I did to you...

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.380
I still love you!

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:40.190
This is the end, so...

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.690
I'm going to die here, so...

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:45.670
So, I'm sorry.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:49.470
At least at the end, let me do what I want...

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:53.840
Kal, you changed me!

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:57.420
Meeting you, all the things we did...

00:15:57.420 --> 00:16:02.460
To me, those are all treasured memories!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.850
They are my treasures!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:15.120
I'm in love with you!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:24.100
Karl, don't let hatred rule you...

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:28.090
Focus only on the light.

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:31.090
Hey!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:38.180
<i>Mother, I finally understand what you meant.</i>

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.750
<i>Goodbye, Kal.</i>

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.610
Claire!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:01.410
Live!

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:09.130
Live?

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.410
Answer my call.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.070
Wind...

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.710
I want to sing with you.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.850
To protect the people I love,

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.480
to protect the Isla I love.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:55.550
So the people I love can keep smiling forever!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.500
I won't let Kal die.

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:02.920
I'll sing a song of love...

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:04.600
To Kal!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:36.840
Altitude 500...

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:38.430
550.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:40.010
600.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:42.010
We're climbing!

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:46.060
The clouds...

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:06.370
If you forgive, the light will 
wipe away the darkness.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:09.900
Mother...

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:12.930
Goodbye.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:14.490
Rest in peace.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.930
Another enemy?

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.680
That's an ally!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.920
The battleship <i>El Bastel</i>.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.480
High Consul Fana Levamme!

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:43.320
The one from before.

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:27.620
Welcome back, stupid older brother!

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:30.900
We're back...

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:33.050
Thanks to me.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.590
Welcome back!

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:50.290
I'm back.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.780
Mr. Bandereas!

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.650
Mr. Bandereas!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:17.480
O-Oh... You guys are still alive?

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:25.960
The whole lot of you is insane.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:29.630
Those two idiots are getting a lecture later.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:33.830
Noripii...

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.180
Benji!

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:46.530
Thank you.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:49.980
<i>The battle was over.</i>

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:53.080
<i>Or so everyone thought...</i>

00:21:53.780 --> 00:21:59.610
<i>But for us to continue our journey, 
another sacrifice was needed.</i>

00:23:31.270 --> 00:23:32.930
It's me, Ignacio.

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.930
I'll be leaving Isla before the journey is over.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:37.930
But at least I won't have to see him anymore.

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:39.890
Lately, his hair—

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:40.960
<b>Episode 12 
The End of the Sky</b>
